{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234410","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234410","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1423441001:1":{"text":"Ugh! You useless guards! Alright, alright, I surrender, okay? Just don't hit me!","source_cn":"哇……你们这些侍卫太、太没用了！别打我，我认错还不行嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F359D012EF3951E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423441002:1":{"text":"Not so high and mighty now, are you?","source_cn":"现在倒是不摆那副贵族的架子了呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F6E03954D9EF98E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1423441002":{"text":"Not so high and mighty now, are you?","source_cn":"现在倒是不摆那副贵族的架子了呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F6E03954D9EF98E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423441003:1":{"text":"I-I get it... I was wrong...","source_cn":"我、我知道啦……我错了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D2D5E04345C9815","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423441004:1":{"text":"Truth is... I knew the little sith had been thrown out by the adults at home...","source_cn":"好吧，其实我知道，小法妖是被家里的大人扔掉的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC27ABC7B934505B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","var